9,The Democratic Republic of the Congo is renowned for its music · Global Voices,https://globalvoices.org/2025/03/27/the-democratic-republic-of-the-congo-is-renowned-for-its-music/,"March 24, 2025 - Another big name is Tabu Ley, or Franco, who became a DRC music icon with his classic hit, “Mario”: Abeti Masikini and Tshala Muana emerged at the turning point between the first and second generations. Zaïko Langa Langa, King Kester Emeneya, Jean-Serge Essous, Madilu System, Édouard Nganga, Théo Blaise Kounkou, Mbilia Bel, Simaro Lutumba, Koffi Olomidé, and the renowned Papa Wemba, known as the King of Congolese Rumba and the King of la Sape (Society of Ambiance-Makers and Elegant People), later joined them.",Ko,Niger-Congo
